# index-captures.py's SQLite index (rebuildable in ~30 s from <game>/BepInEx; 6 MB, or ~500 MB
# once --with-rows materializes a batch). Derived data, never a source of truth — the CSVs are.
# Archive directories written by --archive land under debugtests/<tag>-<date>/ and are already
# covered by the root .gitignore's `debugtests/*/`.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
